# benchmark_clean — version only records + the GENERATED RTL + L-docs + clean input.
# Heavy regeneratable EDA working data (GDS/DEF/netlists/logs/report-dbs) stays out.
*
!*/
!*.md
!**/*.md
!**/input/**
!**/generated_docs/*.json
!**/plugin_output/declaration.json
!**/stage1/rtl/*.v
# verification evidence (small JSON): functional_coverage / code_coverage / hw_test
!**/reports/*.json
# test cases authored for code-coverage (the test deliverable; small)
!**/tests/*.v
!**/tests/*.sv
!**/tests/*.py
# Pillar-1/3 verification test cases + logs (the test deliverable)
!**/verify/*.v
!**/verify/*.sv
!**/verify/*.log
# analog GENERATED evidence (the analog "source" + sized specs + corner results); heavy GDS stays out
!**/phase3/analog/**/*.sp
!**/phase3/analog/**/*.json
!**/phase3/analog/**/*.flag
